---
---

<section class="py-16 bg-slate-800" aria-labelledby="how-it-works-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <h2 id="how-it-works-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">
      How It Works
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400 mb-12 max-w-md mx-auto">
      Build a daily puzzle habit in three easy steps.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 sm:gap-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-lg">
          1
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-2">Solve today's maze</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          A fresh 60×60 puzzle waits every morning. Takes about 10–15 minutes.
          Same maze for everyone, so you can compare times.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Connector line (desktop only) -->
      <div class="hidden sm:block absolute" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-lg">
          2
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-2">Explore the library</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Browse 420+ free printable mazes — small quick ones, medium challenges,
          and large labyrinths. Play online or print at home.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-lg">
          3
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-2">Come back tomorrow</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          A new maze unlocks every day. Keep the streak going — it only takes
          a few minutes and gets a little easier each time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <a
        href="/maze-of-the-day/"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow hover:bg-blue-500 transition-colors"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" />
        </svg>
        Start with Today's Maze
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
